      "image": "assets/images/60598/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until tender, about 2 to 3 minutes. Stir in garlic and ginger; cook and stir until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JOgk6u9EiEmKvtY1mTEYFK_nI9w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/60598-vegetarian-korma-ddmfs-step2-0497-bc762bf1e4d942e4b70775a15f4ab614.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/60598/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in carrots, potatoes, tomato sauce, cashews, and jalapeño. Season with curry powder and salt; cook and stir until potatoes are tender, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pRnNet5lnhI0cG7t_3g0CqjrWPg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/60598-vegetarian-korma-ddmfs-step3-0498-ccf9e85ee64c48f998033f1cb3ab523b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/60598/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in cream, peas, green bell pepper, and red bell pepper; reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 10 minutes. Garnish with cilantro to serve.",
